    lbl('PUBLISHED · local heat-kernel asymptotics (Colin de Verdière–Hillairet–Trélat) · Gaussian bounds (Coulhon–Sikora) · Young on graded groups (Fischer–Ruzhansky)', W / 2, 470, C.cyan, Q(S, 1, 'are published inputs') * fade, 14);
